'''Like the Wind''' (これにてドロン, ''Kore ni te Doron'', '''Now Gone''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (M): Freeze duration is increased by 20%.

